  "fullDescription": "The Health & Fitness Planner Canva Templates is perfect for anyone looking to improve their health lifestyle, or maintain it! Create a Fitness Tracker or various Health and Wellness sheets with this template. You can also use the various sheets for Exercise Log or Tracker, the Weight Loss Tracker sheets, or create a Fitness Journal. It comes in a bright design, but you can change everything in these templates from fonts, colors, elements, shapes, layouts, and more! All you need is a free Canva account!\n\nWhat’s included:\n\n• 63 templates to edit in Canva\n\n• Design: ICE CREAM SHOP\n\n• Sizes: A4 + US LETTER\n\nThe templates include the following:\n\n• My Journey – weight overview sheet\n\n• Before & After photo sheet\n\n• Daily Planner\n\n• Weekly Planner\n\n• Monthly Planner\n\n• Daily Workout Log\n\n• Weekly Exercise Log\n\n• Weight Tracker\n\n• Weight Loss Tracker\n\n• Annual Weight Loss (4 Month Layout x 3 Sheets)\n\n• Weight Gain Chart\n\n• Exercise Examples (with + without equipment)\n\n• Food Journal\n\n• Calorie Tracker\n\n• 30 Day Challenge Tracker\n\n• Weekly Meal Plan\n\n• 4 Week Fitness Tracker\n\n• 8 Week Fitness Tracker\n\n• Walking Log\n\n• Running Log\n\n• Cardio Training Log\n\n• Strength Training Log\n\n• Weight Lifting Chart\n\n• Exercise Log\n\n• Yoga Log\n\n• Steps Tracker\n\n• Running Progress Log\n\n• Fitness Habit Tracker\n\n• Marathon Training Schedule – Miles + Kilometres\n\n• Triathlon Training Log\n\n• Protein Shake Recipes Sheet\n\n• Recipes to try sheet\n\n• Fitness Expenses\n\n• 28 Day Diet Worksheet\n\n• Keto, Paleo & Vegan Shopping Lists\n\n• Cut-List\n\n• Medical Info sheet\n\n• Medical History\n\n• Doctor’s Visitation Record\n\n• Doctor’s Visit Prep Sheet\n\n• Appointment sheets – Doctor, Dentist, Gynaecologist, Chiropractor, Psychologist, blank\n\n• Medical Expenses + detailed sheet\n\n• Insurance Expenses tracker (4-month layout x 3 sheets)\n\n• Health Insurance Info\n\n• 4-month Calendar\n\n• First Aid Kit Checklist\n\n• Water Tracker\n\n• Prescriptions Tracker\n\n• Vitamins Tracker\n\n🤩 FREE BONUS: 10 x free sheets to play around with – sign up via email! (A link to sign up is provided in the ‘BONUS’ PDF upon your purchase 🙂\n\n⚠️ Please take note: These are not fillable PDF files/templates (i.e. you are unable to type directly into the boxes). They are meant to be changed the way you like, with a free Canva account, and printed out to be filled in by hand. If you wish to type directly into the template, you’ll need to manually add text boxes (instructions provided in the help guide pdf).\n\n♥ What is Canva? ♥\n\nFree online design software to create anything you want to!\n\nTHE SUPER IMPORTANT STUFF:\n\n• You will need a Canva account to edit these templates. Don’t worry, it’s free!\n\n• Use a desktop to edit these templates in Canva (though they have an App, it is quite limiting)\n\n• Canva links can NOT be resold, which means that you will need to change them up and download them as a final PDF, PNG, or JPEG.\n\nHOW DOES IT WORK?\n\n1. After purchasing you will be able to download the PDFs (one will contain the link to the template/s, and the other one is the Help Guide)\n\n2. Open the link in the PDF to go to Canva.com, where you can start editing right away 🙂\n\n3. See the Help Guide PDF in case you’re new to Canva — I have added some easy steps with images!\n\n©TWCprintables",
